# Studies published for download on the bsr-studies GitHub Pages site
# (https://rickcreightoninnigeria.github.io/bsr-studies/).
#
# One path per line, relative to "estudy_en (v3)/". Lines starting with # are notes.
# Build the site and update the app's download links with:
#   python3 py/build_studies_site.py
# then commit and push the bsr-studies folder (and this repo's changed locale files).
# Everything listed here becomes public, so add only finished studies whose
# copyright allows them to be shared freely.

